MPR third-party source notice

MPI wire definitions in MPR/MPI/mpi2_min.h, mpi2_target.h, mpi26_devices.h and mpi2_mgmt.h are
transcribed from the FreeBSD sys/dev/mpr/mpi headers. Their upstream
Broadcom copyright and three-clause redistribution terms are retained
below and in those files. The fixed reference source is identified in
PLAN.md section 2.

Controller behavior was compared with the FreeBSD mpr driver. The macOS
IOKit scheduling, DMA ownership and disk policy are implemented for this
project. Linux and Apple OSS reference implementation code is not copied
into this patch. MacKernelSDK remains a separate dependency with its own
license notices. This notice assigns no new license to other project code.

